  <History Date="25-11-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (many controls missing function range details. no pixel layout information)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="12-06-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added Atlabase ID's.  Revised shutter functions in response to customer bug report.  Revised cell layout in line with latest documentation." Version="1" />
  <History Date="26-06-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from CLF Poseidon Wash XL (charts are a mess.  littered with inconsistencies and range conflicts.  very confusing.  effect functions not documented properly and don't make sense)" Version="2" />
